        method           "derived from Joback: s_298 = (dHf_298 - dGf_298)/298.15 + the sum of the elements' standard entropies, with Joback's dGf_298 = -34490 J/mol (not stored: dGf derives from dHf and s_298)";
        methodVersion    "joback-poling5e-table2-2";
